fun and friendly. We had the brown butter burger! It was great!! Next time I'll ask for more cheese bit I was super satisfied. This is my friends favorite place and I understand why. We also had the grilled Brussels sprouts and the garlic fries. We where there at happy hour, which is a great deal. It's in my neighborhood so I'll be back. This is a great date spot. It's cozy and a good place to sit and talk."},{"business_id":"6RDGvdukSq3YHPYvG8sIEQ","review_id":"zJXOSgh_fKNfLyk1f23WXQ","date":"2017-11-15T15:53:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9455075263977051,"text_excerpt":"Walked in on a Friday night; we were able to get a table right away. (It was still pretty early). Our server Lauren was fantastic. She was friendly and did her job really well. We started with the Crab and Corn bisque, y'all this was good! It had lots of flavor. Perfect on a chilly evening. Also had the Chicken Liver Pate' with grilled bread, we really enjoyed it. As our mains, I had the Brown Butter Burger, tasty pimento cheese on top. My husband had the Beef Short Ribs served over yellow grits. He wasn't sold on the grits, but he finished his plate! Located just off Carrollton in Mid City, this is a great dinner option if in the area. While located in a strip-mall-ish like building, Bro..."},{"business_id":"6RDGvdukSq3YHPYvG8sIEQ","review_id":"Cj-EsnSUoCmTjAX_d6a57Q","date":"2018-08-08T20:42:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9413703680038452,"text_excerpt":"I loved my meal here! I'd been wanting to come here for a while and finally got to try it. I tried the brown butter burger which was one of the best burgers I'd had in a while! Nice and juicy, and was cooked perfectly. I loved the pimento cheese on top. And the aioli on the side for fries dipping! I can't wait to come back and try their happy hour and brunch specials!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"6RDGvdukSq3YHPYvG8sIEQ","photo_id":"jtqesGG6BWqz55_WVEa0XQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jtqesGG6BWqz55_WVEa0XQ.jpg","visua